WEBVTT

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:11.550
Harmony is not a flat cage, Architect!

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:15.190
Every curve needs room to breathe and bend!

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:27.240
Take my vector seed to the six heroes!

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:30.700
Forge a hybrid stylus before the light goes flat!

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:36.480
We will not leave you trapped in flat glass, Vector.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.340
Every medium on this desk is coming back for you!
